    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/1/71281.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 35,
    "turn_text": "Jake, I'll be really candid. I think if we had stayed together in the meeting last night, I think that you would have seen Fifth Throne, and I'm not being dramatic when I say that. There is a lot of raw emotions right now. I think it was best to let folks go back home, decompress a little bit, and then come back together.",
