    "turn_idx": 153,
    "turn_text": "No, I mean, you did a great job presiding, but the general message is obviously one of chaos. Do you think Republicans will need to change this motion to vacate rules, no matter who becomes speaker? I interviewed a Congressman Graves earlier today, and he was reluctant to endorse his fellow Louisiana because he needs to know where Scalia stands on motion to vacate because he wants that rule gone. I want that rule",
