        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker views the current situation as comparable to the 1910 crisis in terms of intensity and consequences.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The Republican Party’s chances in 2024 depend significantly on maintaining internal cohesion.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Public perception of chaos negatively impacts voter support for the incumbent party.",
